member.remarks:
This class is intended to be placed in a using block without a variable assignment.

  using (new ConsoleUtilities.ColorScope(ConsoleColor.Blue))
  {
     Console.Out.WriteLine("I am in blue");
  }

Based on the PropertySupport.ExtractPropertyName() method in Prism.

 var name = ExtractPropertyName(() => this.UserName);
 Debug.Assert(name.Equals("UserName"));
